anon","website":"https://saffronkitchens.example.com","description":"Saffron Kitchens operates 18 neighborhood restaurants alongside a high-volume direct delivery app serving 25,000+ weekly orders. We combine hospitality craft with modern kitchen operations, CRM retention, and real-time order logistics."},{"name":"Harbor Finance","size":"201-1000","location":"London, UK","website":"https://harborfinance.example.com","description":"Harbor Finance provides fractional CFO advisory, statutory audit, tax structuring, and cross-border accounting for high-growth SMEs in the UK and Europe. Our advisory squads combine chartered accountants with modern cloud finance tooling."},{"name":"Mediterra Health","size":"201-1000","location":"Beirut, Lebanon","website":"https://mediterrahealth.example.com","description":"Mediterra Health operates three multidisciplinary outpatient clinics, an accredited diagnostic lab, and a 24/7 bilingual telehealth platform. Over 80 clinicians collaborate across primary care, chronic disease management, and preventive screenings."},{"name":"Pinewood Clinics","size":"51-200","location":"Paris, France","website":"https://pinewoodclinics.example.com","description":"Pinewood Clinics is a network of six community family-medicine, physiotherapy, and pharmacy clinics across Île-de-France. We focus on coordinated, unhurried outpatient care backed by shared electronic medical records."},{"name":"Brightpath Academy","size":"51-200","location":"Amman, Jordan","website":"https://brightpathacademy.example.com","description":"Brightpath Academy is a bilingual K–12 international school serving 950 students in Amman alongside a growing blended online learning division. Our faculty emphasizes inquiry-led STEM, strong literacy foundations, and individualized student mentoring."},{"name":"Atlas Structures","size":"201-1000","location":"Riyadh, Saudi Arabia","website":"https://atlasstructures.example.com","description":"Atlas Structures engineers and delivers commercial