liarity with CMS tools (Webflow, WordPress, or Shopify) and Ahrefs/Semrush.\n\nCompensation & benefits:\n- Monthly salary: $1,100–$1,800 USD / month (Full-time, Remote)\n- Comprehensive health insurance and 21 days paid annual leave\n- Creative software subscriptions and portfolio production support\n- Quarterly team showcases and annual performance bonus\n- Flexible Thursday afternoon finish during non-campaign weeks\n\nHiring process:\n- 1. 25-minute intro call on role expectations, schedule, and monthly salary range\n- 2. Role-specific practical case or competency interview with the hiring manager\n- 3. Final team & leadership alignment conversation","field":"Marketing","seniority":"junior","type":"full_time","mode":"remote","location":"Remote","skills":["Copywriting","SEO","Content Strategy","Editing","Social Media"],"reqs":["Strong portfolio of 3–5 published writing samples (articles, landing pages, or brand campaigns) in English.","1+ year of agency, freelance, or in-house copywriting/content experience.","Solid understanding of on-page SEO fundamentals and clear, jargon-free editing.","Ability to hit deadlines across parallel client retainers in a remote setup."],"lo":1100,"hi":1800,"days":1,"hours":21},{"company":"Olive & Co","title":"Social Media Manager","description":"Olive & Co is a creative brand and performance growth agency helping consumer, F&B, and lifestyle brands scale across the MENA region. Our strategists, designers, and media buyers manage end-to-end launches from identity to paid acquisition. We're hiring a Social Media Manager to join the team (on-site, Dubai, UAE).\n\nAbout the role:\nOwn monthly social calendars, creator collaborations, and day-to-day community voice for flagship retail and lifestyle accounts in Dubai.\n\nWhat you'll do:\n- Build monthly content calendars spanning Reels, carousels, Stories, and timely cultural moments.\n- Direct on-site content shoots and coordinate with designers/videographers for fast-turnaround assets.\